{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/extras/c88e1ee21a63bee1f5ccddcb8787b268.avif?t=1773233165\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heal, investigate, and endure in Late Antiquity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rod of Asclepius</i> is a historical RPG set in 4th-century <i>Pannonia</i> <i>Secunda</i>. You play a Roman <i>medicus\u00a0</i>(doctor); diagnosing illnesses, gathering herbs, performing treatments, and making difficult calls as war and disease reshape everyday life. Your choices carry weight: patients remember, communities talk, and your reputation follows you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/extras/fb16f7a99d5b08619b241304180496f0.avif?t=1773233165\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic historical setting</strong> \u2014 Explore archaeologically researched Roman locations, customs, and medical practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based medical procedures</strong> \u2014 From surgery to remedies and aftercare, success depends on skill and judgment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management</strong> \u2014 Collect tools, medicinal plants, and rare ingredients to craft life-saving treatments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isometric 2.5D </strong>\u2014 A distinctive aesthetic that brings Late Antiquity to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation and diagnosis</strong> \u2014 Question patients, read symptoms, and untangle medical mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morality and reputation</strong> \u2014 Your ethics shape how people treat you; and who will trust you. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive as a healer in a collapsing empire? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Medicine of Antiquity Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and begin your journey into the world of Roman healing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484030?t=1773233165","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/863cb8fb0720470ea3be0acfa957c8282b24476b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773233165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/0116c648e1432255ca8bc849400b0604bc49022b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773233165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/0116c648e1432255ca8bc849400b0604bc49022b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773233165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4023610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/extras/c88e1ee21a63bee1f5ccddcb8787b268.avif?t=1773233165\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heal, investigate, and endure in Late Antiquity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rod of Asclepius</i> is a historical RPG set in 4th-century <i>Pannonia</i> <i>Secunda</i>. You play a Roman <i>medicus\u00a0</i>(doctor); diagnosing illnesses, gathering herbs, performing treatments, and making difficult calls as war and disease reshape everyday life. Your choices carry weight: patients remember, communities talk, and your reputation follows you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484030/extras/fb16f7a99d5b08619b241304180496f0.avif?t=1773233165\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic historical setting</strong> \u2014 Explore archaeologically researched Roman locations, customs, and medical practice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based medical procedures</strong> \u2014 From surgery to remedies and aftercare, success depends on skill and judgment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management</strong> \u2014 Collect tools, medicinal plants, and rare ingredients to craft life-saving treatments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isometric 2.5D </strong>\u2014 A distinctive aesthetic that brings Late Antiquity to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation and diagnosis</strong> \u2014 Question patients, read symptoms, and untangle medical mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morality and reputation</strong> \u2014 Your ethics shape how people treat you; and who will trust you. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive as a healer in a collapsing empire? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Medicine of Antiquity Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and begin your journey into the world of Roman healing.</p>","developers":["Worcco Arts"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG